  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f5b87ef8-fe94-5ada-975e-7aadfd37f685" activityNameId="d108e1e2-560b-553c-8eb2-80694f7b9bfa" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Assembly, LCD screen</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Assembly, LCD screen
Data are based on information in a US-EPA LCA study about LCD and CRT production. The data represent the respective efforts for a 15-inch LCD computer screen, as it is produced in Japan.;
UUID: c73911e5-0213-33bb-ab66-7f845969caad
This module includes the auxiliaries and energy efforts as well as the related emissions (air/water) and waste amounts for the assembly of a complete LCD screen. Estimations for infrastructure and the overall transport amounts (incl. for the materials in this screen) are included as well.
Location: Data from literature (based on information from Japanese producers) ? used as data for the global production average
Technology: Current technology in Japan
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c73911e5-0213-33bb-ab66-7f845969caad.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
